  FT["PH-H3456"] = {"id":"PH-H3456","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation）","sourceUrl":"https://lawphil.net/statutes/repacts/ra1965/ra_4254_1965.html","fetchedAt":"2026-10-06","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"规定在南伊罗戈省Sta. Lucia市镇设立急诊医院，名称为Sta. Lucia急诊医院，并授权为此拨款的法案","en":"An Act Providing for the Establishment of an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Sta. Lucia, Province of Ilocos Sur, to be Known as the Sta. Lucia Emergency Hospital, and Authorizing the Appropriation of Funds Therefor","orig":"An Act Providing for the Establishment of an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Sta. Lucia, Province of Ilocos Sur, to be Known as the Sta. Lucia Emergency Hospital, and Authorizing the Appropriation of Funds Therefor","vi":"Đạo luật thành lập Bệnh viện Cấp cứu tại Thị trấn Sta. Lucia, Tỉnh Ilocos Sur với tên gọi Bệnh viện Cấp cứu Sta. Lucia, và phân bổ kinh phí cho mục đích này","th":"พระราชบัญญัติจัดตั้งโรงพยาบาลฉุกเฉินในเทศบาล Sta. Lucia จังหวัด Ilocos Sur ในชื่อโรงพยาบาลฉุกเฉิน Sta. Lucia และจัดสรรเงินทุนสำหรับการนี้","id":"Undang-Undang membentuk Rumah Sakit Gawat Darurat di Kotamadya Sta. Lucia, Provinsi Ilocos Sur dengan nama Rumah Sakit Gawat Darurat Sta. Lucia, dan mengalokasikan dana untuk itu","ms":"Akta menubuhkan Hospital Kecemasan di Perbandaran Sta. Lucia, Wilayah Ilocos Sur dengan nama Hospital Kecemasan Sta. Lucia, dan memperuntukkan dana untuk itu"},"level":"law","status":"active","topics":["health"],"docNumber":"Republic Act No. 4254","issuingBody":"Congress of the Philippines","promulgatedDate":"1965-06-19","completenessNote":"全文，共 3 条；逐字取自 LawPhil 菲律宾法律虚拟图书馆（The LawPhil Project – Arellano Law Foundation） 官方页面（statutes/repacts/ra1965/ra_4254_1965.html），未改写、未摘译、未节选；原文语言：英语。 条文抬头依源文为 “Section N.” 等形式，本库统一规范为 “Section N.”；首行抬头与条内标题的分段依源文块级边界还原。","country":"PH","countryName":"菲律宾","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"PH-H3456-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"There shall be established, under the direct supervision of the Director of Medical Services, an emergency hospital in the Municipality of Sta. Lucia, Province of Ilocos Sur, to be known as the Sta. Lucia Emergency Hospital."}},{"id":"PH-H3456-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"The sum of two hundred fifty thousand pesos is hereby authorized to be appropriated out of any funds in the National Treasury not otherwise appropriated, for the establishment, operation and maintenance of said hospital during the fiscal year nineteen hundred sixty-six, including the purchase of the site and the construction of buildings thereof. Thereafter, such sum as may be needed for its operation and maintenance shall be included in the annual General Appropriations Act."}},{"id":"PH-H3456-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"This Act shall take effect upon its approval.\nApproved: June 19, 1965."}}],"pack":"ph-p49","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1837-PH-7575","source":"An Act Providing for the Establishment of an Emergency Hospital in the Municipality of Sta. Lucia, Province of Ilocos Sur, to be Known as the Sta. Lucia Emergency Hospital, and Authorizing the Appropriation of Funds Therefor","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
